{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "سَأَلَكَ", "translation": "ask you"}, {"text": "عِبَادِى", "translation": "My servants"}, {"text": "عَنِّى", "translation": "about Me"}, {"text": "فَإِنِّى", "translation": "then indeed I am"}, {"text": "قَرِيبٌ ۖ", "translation": "near"}, {"text": "أُجِيبُ", "translation": "I respond"}, {"text": "دَعْوَةَ", "translation": "(to the) invocation"}, {"text": "ٱلدَّاعِ", "translation": "(of) the supplicant"}, {"text": "إِذَا", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "دَعَانِ ۖ", "translation": "he calls Me"}, {"text": "فَلْيَسْتَجِيبُوا۟", "translation": "So let them respond"}, {"text": "لِى", "translation": "to Me"}, {"text": "وَلْيُؤْمِنُوا۟", "translation": "and let them believe"}, {"text": "بِى", "translation": "in Me"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّهُمْ", "translation": "so that they may"}, {"text": "يَرْشُدُونَ", "translation": "(be) led aright"}], "sahih": "And when My servants ask you, [O Muḥammad], concerning Me - indeed I am near. I respond to the invocation of the supplicant when he calls upon Me. So let them respond to Me [by obedience] and believe in Me that they may be [rightly] guided."}